    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**G5 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=windows&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for G5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=windows-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows 7 for G5 \u00b7 Stock - XP/7/8.1 \u00b7 SP Flash Tool guide\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=linux&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for G5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"htt